1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,240
[Music]
[音乐]

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:09,840
For a whole year, I've been following a remarkable family of baby elephants in Kenya.
一整年，我都在观察肯尼亚一群非常特别的小象家族。

3
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:12,000
[Music]
[音乐]

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,440
A family of elephants raised by people.
这是一群由人类抚养的大象家族。

5
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:22,480
Everyone of these little elephants is an orphan, rescued from the wild having lost their mother.
这些小象都是孤儿，它们在野外失去母亲后被救起。

6
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:26,240
They've all been brought to a unique nursery in Nairobi,
它们都被送到了内罗毕的一个特殊育婴室，

7
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:29,920
where they receive the intense love and care that they desperately need.
在那里，它们得到了它们所急需的关爱与呵护。

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:35,840
[Music]
[音乐]

9
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:39,600
All of these babies have been saved from certain death in the wild,
这些小象都从野外的死亡边缘被救了下来，

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,840
by the vision of one woman, Daphne Sheldon.
这一切都是因为一位名叫达芙妮·谢尔登的女性所做出的努力。

11
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:46,800
Together with her team of dedicated keepers,
与她那由忠诚的守护者组成的团队一起，

12
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:52,000
she's giving orphaned baby elephants a second chance for a normal life in the wild,
她正在给失去父母的幼象们提供在野外过正常生活的机会，

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,560
where they belong.
在它们该在的地方。

14
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,240
By the time they're two years old, the young babies are ready to leave the
当它们两岁时，这些小婴儿已经准备好离开育儿室的安全环境，被带到这里来。

15
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:01,120
security of the nursery and are brought here.
育婴室的安全问题，便被带到了这里。

16
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:05,360
This is Savo National Park and we're about 350 kilometres east
这里是萨沃国家公园，我们位于米凯拉在内罗毕孤儿院所在的地点以东约350公里处。

17
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:08,080
of where Michaela is at the Nairobi orphanage.
关于米凯拉在内罗毕孤儿院的位置。

18
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:12,880
And I've been following the older orphans as they make their long and difficult journey
我一直在关注那些年长的孤儿们，他们正在经历漫长而艰难的回归野外的旅程。

19
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:15,120
back into the wild.
回到自然之中。

20
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:19,920
Yesterday on Elephant Diaries, the convoy carrying six orphaned baby elephants
昨天在《大象日记》节目中，那支载有六只孤儿小象的车队

21
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:25,200
to their new life in Savo, was forced to stop when one of the elephants began to panel.
他们进入萨沃的新生活后，当其中一头大象开始咆哮时，他们不得不停止行动。

22
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:33,040
How do you help them?
你如何帮助它们？

23
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:37,040
They're getting so agitated that they've begun to choke
它们变得如此激动，甚至开始窒息。

24
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:39,840
and that's putting people's life in danger.
这危及了人们的生命。

25
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:50,880
[Music]
[音乐]

26
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,400
That's so passionate.
真是充满激情。

27
00:01:52,400 --> 00:02:05,600
Oh my goodness, this is awful.
天哪，这太糟糕了。

28
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:12,080
[Music]
[音乐]

29
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:19,920
[Music]
[音乐]

30
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:24,080
We just checked the keeper out and he is okay but it's so surprising that it's
我们刚刚检查了饲养员，他没事，但令人惊讶的是……

31
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:27,280
Neposia that has completely freaked out.
完全被吓坏的尼波西。

32
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:31,200
Neposia always seems so calm.
尼波西总是如此平静。

33
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:37,760
Quick thinking has saved the lives of the keepers trapped inside the truck.
迅速的思考拯救了被困在卡车里的守护者们的性命。

34
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:41,120
And everyone hopes that the distraction of freshly cut food
大家都希望，新鲜切割出的食物能分散他们的注意力，

35
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:45,840
will help little Neposia deal with the trauma of this journey.
帮助小尼波西应对这次旅程带来的创伤。

36
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:49,120
Although it's very stressful for everyone involved,
尽管对所有参与者来说都非常紧张，

37
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:53,360
we all hope it will be worth it.
但我们都希望这一切都是值得的。

38
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:57,360
The six little orphans in these trucks are part of a new venture.
这些卡车里的六只孤儿属于一项新的计划。

39
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:00,400
They're destined to form a new orphan herded at Thumba,
他们注定会在图姆巴形成一个新的孤儿群体，

40
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:03,760
a new release site in a remote corner of Savo.
那是萨沃地区一个偏远地区的新的安置点。

41
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:05,680
John, we're up again, are we?
约翰，我们又开始了，对吧？

42
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:09,520
Okay.
好的。

43
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:14,560
It's going to be an enormous challenge but if all goes well the hope is that over
这将会是一个巨大的挑战，但如果一切顺利的话，希望能够……

44
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:19,920
the coming years they will gradually return to Living Wild.
在未来几年里，它们将逐渐回归野生状态。

45
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:32,320
[Music]
[音乐]

46
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:35,920
This is going to be such a surprise for all of the orphans.
这对所有孤儿们来说都会是个巨大的惊喜。

47
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:38,080
This vegetation is very different tonight.
今晚的植被与平时大不相同。

48
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:40,000
I really think it's a lot drier for a star.
我觉得作为一颗星星，这里确实干燥多了。

49
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:44,000
There's not as many nights juicy green bushes.
现在没有那么多的绿色灌木丛了。

50
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,600
So, I hope they're going to like their new home.
希望他们能喜欢他们的新家。

51
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:51,040
[Music]
[音乐]

52
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:55,920
On Vodar convoy is Wendy, the mini matriarch of the nursery babies.
在沃达尔车队中，温迪是那些婴儿们的“小家长”。

53
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:58,560
Although Nairobi is now far behind us,
虽然内罗毕现在已远去，

54
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,880
I can't help thinking about the nursery and the four
我还是忍不住想起那个婴儿房，以及我们留下的那四只

55
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:04,240
leaderless little elephants we left behind.
没有领袖的小象。

56
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:08,800
Everyone's worried that losing Wendy will make them feel extremely unsettled.
大家都担心失去温迪会让他们感到极度不安。

57
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,160
Headkeeper Edwin has been keeping a close eye on them.
负责人埃德温一直密切地关注着它们。

58
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:15,280
All the young ones are very,
所有的幼崽都非常，

59
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:18,800
very much scared after all the big ones have left.
在那些大动物离开后，它们也非常害怕。

60
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:21,680
[Music]
[音乐]

61
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:24,800
Dhammatri is showing some signs of difficulty.
达玛特里似乎遇到了一些困难。

62
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,560
He does not want to come to the keepers.
他不想去见那些守护者。

63
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:31,600
He does not want to go to the other three who are upset or down.
他也不想去见那三个情绪不佳或状态不佳的人。

64
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:35,600
Dhammatri is doing all these because he was very much close to Wendy
达玛特里这么做都是因为他与温迪非常亲近，

65
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,680
and he took Wendy as the mother.
甚至把温迪当作自己的母亲一样对待。

66
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:44,400
And even at night he wanted to sleep with Wendy.
甚至在夜晚，他也想和温迪一起睡觉。

67
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:48,400
[Music]
[音乐]

68
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:54,880
But we hope after a short time he will come to town with that.
但我们希望过一段时间后，他能带着温迪一起回到镇上。

69
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:59,680
Wendy is not there and he has to cope with the other three
温迪不在那里，他只能与那三个人相处，

70
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,840
and be close to the keepers.
并且要与那些守护者保持亲密关系。

71
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:06,080
All Edwin and the keepers can do is offer love and comfort
埃德温和那些看守人所能做的，只有给予爱与安慰。

72
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:20,640
but no one really knows if he will ever be able to cope with his new loss.
但没人真正知道他是否能够承受这次新的失去。

73
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:26,080
This is Voi in the south of Sarvo and most of the young elephants here
这是萨沃尔南部的沃伊，这里的大多数小象都是如此。

74
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:28,560
came from the Nairobi nursery.
它们来自内罗毕的育幼场。

75
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:33,040
Now they're learning what it takes to go back to the wild.
现在，它们正在学习如何回归野生生活。

76
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:37,200
For the time being at least this herd still has its matriarch
至少目前，这群动物仍然有它们的首领。

77
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:42,640
a 10-year-old orphan called Emily but they're also facing major changes.
有一只10岁的孤儿叫艾米丽，但他们也面临着巨大的变化。

78
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:45,600
The Sarvo herd has grown enormously from just a few individuals.
萨沃兽群从最初几只个体发展成了庞大的群体。

79
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:50,080
There's now 30 and so it's been decided to actually split the herd up.
现在共有30只，因此决定将兽群分开。

80
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:53,680
Four females have been selected for a very special job
有四只雌性被选中去承担一项非常特殊的任务。

81
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:57,520
helping the six orphans with Michaela cope in their new home.
帮助米凯拉和那六只孤儿在新家适应生活。

82
00:05:57,520 --> 00:06:00,320
The plan is that they'll lead the new orphan herd
计划是让它们带领新的孤儿群。

83
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:08,400
and in time one of them will rise to the challenge and become the new matriarch.
随着时间的推移，其中一只会迎接挑战，成为新的族长。

84
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:11,200
These older more experienced elephants here in Voi
这里沃伊的那些年长且经验丰富的大象们

85
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:14,720
are about to be taken north to the new release sighted at Thumba
即将被带到北方，前往图姆巴的新栖息地。

86
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:21,840
to join up with the little ones already on their way there from Nairobi.
与那些从内罗毕赶往那里的幼象们会合。

87
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:26,160
So as Emily leads the others out for the day
因此，当艾米丽带领其他大象外出时

88
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:32,720
the four chosen females have been left behind in preparation for the big move.
那四只被选中的雌性大象则被留下来，为这次大迁徙做准备。

89
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:37,520
Now these are our four girls that are going to go north up to a Thumba
现在，就是我们的四只女孩，它们将前往北方，去图姆巴。

90
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:41,760
and they've been kept back for the moment so the rest of the herds already gone out to feed
目前它们被留了下来，因为其余的象群已经出发去觅食了。

91
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:44,720
but we've put some treats just down there at that concrete ramp.
不过，我们在那个混凝土坡道下面放了一些美食。

92
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,800
That's where the trucks are going to come to
卡车就会从那里经过。

93
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:51,200
just to get them used to the idea of going down there.
就是为了让它们习惯去那里。

94
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:56,000
Among their favourite treats is a brown powder called copper.
它们最喜欢的美食之一是一种叫做铜的棕色粉末。

95
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:00,320
And the copra, what actually is that? What's in copra?
那么，椰肉到底是什么？椰肉里有什么？

96
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:02,480
The copra is coconut.
椰肉就是椰子。

97
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:07,280
It's coconut, which has got a lot of nutrients so that's really good for them.
椰子含有大量营养，对它们非常有益。

98
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:10,800
So it's not just a treat, it's actually also very good with the young elephants.
所以这不仅仅是美食，对幼象来说也很有好处。

99
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:13,760
Well they obviously like it. Have you ever tried it?
显然它们很喜欢它。你试过吗？

100
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:16,000
Should we see what it's like?
我们应该去看看它是什么样子的吗？

101
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,760
The difference.
差异。

102
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,240
Is it good?
好吗？

103
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:26,000
It has to be very little. Actually that's pretty good.
必须非常少。实际上，这已经很好了。

104
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:33,680
This is a real treat for them and it's all part of this process of just trying to get
这对他们来说真是一种享受，这完全属于试图推进这一过程的范畴。

105
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:37,360
them used to the idea that it's okay to be coming here that this is
他们原本认为来这里并无问题，这就是……

106
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:41,200
not something for them to be nervous about. Isn't it?
这不是他们应该担心的事情，对吧？

107
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:46,000
Yeah. This is Kinna, you can see with that sunburned ear.
没错。这是金娜，从她那被晒伤的耳朵上就能看出来。

108
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:49,760
The tops of her ears were severely burnt when she was a baby.
她小时候，耳朵顶部被严重烧伤了。

109
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:55,680
She'd lost her family and was stuck for days in mud out in the scorching sun.
她失去了家人，在烈日下被困在泥里好几天。

110
00:07:55,680 --> 00:08:04,560
Oh no, she's decided that she will take that was a gift Kinna.
哦，不，她决定接受那件礼物，因为那是金娜送的。

111
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,520
You're not limited to that.
你不必局限于此。

112
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,520
Oh great, thank you very much.
哦，太好了，非常感谢。

113
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:13,600
Okay that's enough, I think we should be following the rest of the herd again out there
好吧，够了，我觉得我们应该继续跟着其他人去那里。

114
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:16,240
where the real grub is. Come on you lot, let's go.
那里有真正的美食。来吧，大家，我们走吧。

115
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:20,880
Okay, have you got our four ellies used to the loading ramp,
好的，你们把我们的四只狗训练得能上装卸台了吗？

116
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:23,840
they can rejoin Emily and the rest of their chons.
它们可以重新和艾米丽以及它的其他狗们一起回去。

117
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:26,000
Hey, thanks come family now, what are you doing Emily?
嘿，谢谢，现在大家一起走吧，艾米丽，你在做什么？

118
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:30,880
That real sort of jaunty bouncy movement there.
那是一种非常欢快、有活力的动作。

119
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:33,920
Hello Emily.
嗨，艾米丽。

120
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:42,560
Emily. Emily.
艾米丽。艾米丽。

121
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:45,360
No Emily, that's not for you.
不，艾米丽，那不适合你。

122
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,480
Joseph, did you ask me?
约瑟夫，你问过我吗？

123
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,560
Actually, yeah, she's going to, I think she might damage it.
其实，是的，她会这么做的。我觉得她可能会损坏它。

124
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:58,160
I don't know, I think maybe she's uh, listen, you see here now.
我不知道，也许她会……听着，你现在就看到了。

125
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:03,040
It's the other four and Emily's talking to them.
是另外四个人和艾米丽在和他们说话。

126
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,680
Even with her back turn, she knew they were there.
即使她背对着他们，她也知道他们就在那里。

127
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:10,800
This is actually going to be the last time that they will join the herd of a morning.
这实际上将是他们最后一次参与早晨的集体活动了。

128
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:17,760
See that excitement now, they're coming back.
看，他们现在很兴奋，他们要回来了。

129
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:29,200
Emily's helped teach these four everything they know.
艾米丽帮助这四个人学会了他们所知道的一切。

130
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:32,560
The gamble is, will they take that knowledge with them to a thumber?
关键在于，他们是否会把这些知识带回去给其他人呢？

131
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:37,360
The future of the new herd depends on it.
新群落的未来取决于此。

132
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:40,000
Problem is, none of them is more than five years old,
问题在于，它们中没有任何一只能活过五年，

133
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:43,520
and by Ellie's standards that makes them still young children.
按照埃莉的标准来看，它们仍然还是幼兽。

134
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:46,640
So none of us know if the move will be successful.
因此，我们谁都不知道这次迁移是否会成功。

135
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:52,000
With all six little orphans from Nairobi still on board,
还有六只来自内罗毕的孤儿还在车上，

136
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,440
we're approaching their new home.
我们正在接近它们的新家。

137
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:56,320
It's the long way north of where Jonathan is.
那里位于乔纳森所在位置以北的漫长路途上。

138
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:19,440
We've been driving seven hours and we've just gone through the gates of Sarvo National Park.
我们开车了七个小时，终于穿过了萨沃尔国家公园的大门。

139
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:23,120
We've still got a little bit further to go because we're going to a thumber,
我们还有一段路要走，因为我们要去一个瀑布处，

140
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:25,600
which is in the north part of East Sarvo.
那个地方位于东萨沃尔的北部地区。

